  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.1: NuGet metadata polish. Adds PackageIcon + PackageReadmeFile so the package displays a logo and README on its NuGet page. Removes em-dash from the previous release notes. No code changes. 10.0.0: initial release. The [ScrapeSchema] and [ScrapeField] attributes plus SchemaFieldType consumed by the WebReaper.Extraction.Generators Roslyn source generator (ADR-0045). Multi-targeted to netstandard2.0 (so the analyzer can reference it) and net10.0 (so user code can use it at runtime). Lightweight, no runtime deps beyond the BCL. Pairs with WebReaper.Extraction.Generators; requires WebReaper 10.0.0 at runtime.",
